     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "Register 0x20..0x37 holds the wave table number's ninth bit in bit 0 and F-number bits 0-6 in bits 1-7.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:3rdparty/ymfm/src/ymfm_pcm.h",
       "lines": "188-189",
       "sha": "1c96b0a2142f277d69a8e6dce9409c9924ba6cb87e77ed3865f75bb46b134b70"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "The nine-bit wave table number combines 0x08..0x1F with bit 0 of this register.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:3rdparty/ymfm/src/ymfm_pcm.h",
       "lines": "188",
       "sha": "dbe60df46ad8eef2b1bc2aaf8eb8dd1b5b24685b084f1f2c7a928d8dc9c294dd"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "F-number bits 0-6 combine with bits 0-2 of 0x38 to give the ten-bit F-number.",
     "quotes": [
